data: {"id": "cf9ca6280e4744f9-thinking-parallel_evidence-514", "run_id": "cf9ca6280e4744f9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 调查计划与工具执行\n\n我将首先并行执行 plan 中的 kubectl_describe、run_bash_command，并获取 Pod YAML 以确认容器名和镜像配置；同时基于已有 baseline 继续验证。\n\n**计划步骤：**\n1. `kubectl_describe` - 获取 Pod 状态、Events 和 Waiting 详情\n2. `kubectl get_yaml` - 获取 Pod YAML 确认镜像配置和 imagePullSecrets\n3. `run_bash_command` - 获取 nodeName\n4. 基于上述结果，如有需要再查询具体事件详情\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1788765539802, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

