data: {"id": "cf9ca6280e4744f9-thinking-parallel_evidence-1318", "run_id": "cf9ca6280e4744f9", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 采集事实\n\n### Kubernetes 事实\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：Pending，Container 处于 Waiting 状态，Reason = ImagePullBackOff\n2. **容器配置**：\n   - 容器名：app\n   - 镜像：`registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing`\n   - ImagePullPolicy：Always\n   - 无 imagePullSecrets（serviceAccountName: default）\n3. **Events 关键信息**（13m 前首次，持续 15 分钟）：\n   - `Failed to pull image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`：`failed to resolve reference \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\": failed to do request: Head \"https://registry.invalid/v2/aiops/", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788765551717, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

